24,10,22)\">Jer 10:22</ref>, or wheels <ref ref=\"Nah 3:2\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,2)\">Nah 3:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>quaking, trembling</highlight>, of person <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,18)\">Ezek 12:18</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>shaking, quivering</highlight>, of horse eager to start <ref ref=\"Job 39:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,24)\">Job 39:24</ref> (+ <bdbheb>רֹגֶז</bdbheb>), of dart <ref ref=\"Job 41:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,21)\">Job 41:21</ref> (al. <highlight>rushing sound</highlight>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Jer 10:22", "book": "JER", "chapter": 10, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "1Kgs 19:11", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 19, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Nah 3:2", "book": "NAM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Job 41:21", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 41, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Amos 1:1", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 1, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Zech 14:5", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 14, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "1Kgs 19:12", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 19, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 29:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 29, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ezek 38:19", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 38, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Ezek 3:12", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 3, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Ezek 3:13", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 3, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ezek 37:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 37, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 9:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 9, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Jer 47:3", "book": "JER", "chapter": 47, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ezek 12:18", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 12, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Job 39:24", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 39, "verse": 24}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["רַ֫עַשׁ", "׳", "ר", "י", "קוֺל", "גָּרוֺל", "ᵐ5", "רֹגֶז"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "ab